hadiths[255]{hadithnumber,text}:
"4449","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : aadmi ki behtareen khurak wo hai jo wo apni mehnat sey kama kar khaye. aur aulad bhi aadmi ki apni kamai hai."
"4450","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey manqul hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : tumhari aulad tumhari behtareen kamai hai, lihaza tum apni aulad ki kamai kha saktey ho."
"4451","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey marwi hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : aadmi ki behtareen khurak wo hai jo wo apni mehnat sey kama kar khaye. aur uski aulad bhi uski kamai hi hai."
"4452","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) bayan karti hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : insan ki pakizah tareen khurak wo hai jo wo apni kamai sey khaye. aur uski aulad bhi uski kamai hi hai."
"4454","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : logon par eik aisa waqt aayega ke aadmi parwa nahin kerega ke maal kahan sey aa raha hai? halal (tareeqey) sey ya haram sey?"
"4455","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey manqul hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : logon par aisa waqt aayega ke umuman log sood khor hongey. jo shakhs baraahe-raast sood khor na hoga, usey sood ka ghubar to zarur pahuncheyga."
"4456","Hazrat Amr bin Taghlab (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : be-shak ye bhi qiyamat ki nishaniyan hain ke maal aam aur bahut ziyada ho jaeyga. tijarat phel jaeygi. ilm (dekhney mein) aam hoga (magar) aadmi koi sauda kerega to kahega : main sauda pakka nahin karta yahan tak ke main falan qabiley key taajir sey mashwara kar lun. aur eik bahut badey qabiley mein kaatib talash kiya jaeyga to nahin milega."
"4457","Hazrat Hakim bin Hizam (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : do kharid o farokht karney waley jab tak eik dusrey sey juda na hon, unhen soda khatam karney ka ikhtiyar rehta hai. agar wo dono sach bolen aur har baat wazahat sey bayan kar den to unkey sodey mein barkat hogi. aur agar wo jhoot bolen aur soorate-hal chupa lein to unkey sodey sey barkat uth jaeygi."
"4458","Hazrat Noman bin Bashir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey suna, aur Allah ki qism ! main aap key baad kisi sey na sunoonga, aap farma rahey they : halal wazeh hai, haram bhi wazeh hai lekin unkey darmiyan kuchh shubeh wali cheezen bhi hain. is silsiley mein, main tumhen eik misal bayan karta hun. yaqinan Allah Taala ney kuchh ilaaqa mamnoo (ghair qanuni) qarar diya hai aur wo ilaaqa Allah Taala ki haram karda cheezen hain. jo shakhs us mamnoo ilaqey key qarib qarib (janwer) charaaeyga, bahut mumkin hai ke wo us mamnooa' (ghair qanuni) ilaqey mein charney lagey. isi tarah jo shakhs shubeh wala kaam karta hai, bahut mumkin hai ke wo haram kaam par bhi himmat kar bethey."
"4459","Hazrat Abu-Zar (Raziallahu anhu) sey manqul hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : teen shakhs aisey hain ke Allah Taala qiyamat key din unko (nazar rehmat o mohabbat sey) nahin dekhega, aur na in ko pak kerega aur unkey liye takleef deh azab hoga. wo shakhs jo apney atiye par ehsan jatlata hai. jo shakhs apna tehband latkata hai aur jo shakhs jhoot bol kar apna saman bechta hai."
"4460","Hazrat abu-Qatada Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) sey marwi hai ke unhoney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey suna : soda kartey waqt ziyada qasmen na khaya karo kyonkey (jhooti) qism sey saman to bik jata hai magar barkat uth jati hai."
"4461","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : qism uthaney sey saman to farokht ho jata hai magar kamai (ki barkat) khatam ho jati hai."
"4462","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : teen shakhs aisey hain ke Allah Taala qiyamat key din un sey kalam nahin farmaeyga, na unko dekhega aur na unko pak hi kerega. aur unkey liye dardnak azab hoga. eik wo aadmi jiskey yahan guzargaah key paas (uski zarurat sey) faaltu pani hai lekin wo musafir ko pani leney sey rok dey. doosra wo aadmi jo sirf dunyawi mafad ki khatir kisi Imam sey baiat karta hai. agar Imam us ko uski mansha key mutabiq deta rahey to wo baiat par qaaim rehta hai aur agar na dey to tod deta hai. teesra wo shakhs jo kisi aadmi sey Asr key baad saman ka bhaaw karta hai aur Allah ki qism kha kar kehta hai ke is saman key badley usey is qadr raqam milti thi (halanke usey itni raqam nahin milti thi) doosra uski tasdeeq kar deta hai (aur saman kharid leta hai )."
"4463","Hazrat Qais bin abi Gharza (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke hum Madina Munawra mein ghalley waghera ki kharid o farokht kya kartey they aur hum apney aap ko samsar kaha kartey they. log bhi hamen usi lafz sey jantey they yahan tak ke eik din Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) hamarey yahan ( bazar mein) tashrif laye aur hamen aisey naam sey pukara jo hamarey rakhey huye naam sey badarjaha behtar tha : aap ney farmaya : aey tajiron ki jamaat! tumharey sodon mein bila-irada qasmen aur fuzul baaten waqey hoti rehti hain, lihaza tum sadqa kya karo."
"4464","Hazrat Hakim bin Hizam (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kharid o farokht karney waley do shakhs juda honey sey pehley sodey ki wapsi ka ikhtiyar rakhtey hain. agar wo har baat wazeh bayan kar den aur sach bolen to un ki bai mein barkat hogi. aur agar wo jhoot bolen aur soorate-hal ko chupaeyn to unkey sodey sey barkat uth jaeygi."
"4465","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kharid o farokht karney waley do ashkhas mein sey har eik ko ikhtiyar hota hai ke wo juda honey sey pehley soda wapis kerey. albatta khiyaar sodey mein aisey nahin hota."
"4466","Al-Laith ne Nafi se, unhon ne Ibn Umar se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: RasoolAllah ne farmaya: kharidne aur bechne wale dono ko ikhtiyar hai jab tak woh juda na ho jaayein ya aapas mein ikhtiyar karna chun lein. Ya shayad Nafi ne kaha: ya un mein se ek ne doosre se kaha: faisla kar lo! (Sahih)"
"4467","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey marwi hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : do soda karney waley jab tak juda na hon, wapsi ka ikhtiyar rakhtey hain illa ye ke wo soda khiyaar wala ho. agar sodey mein ikhtiyar khatam kar diya gaya ho to bai pakki ho gaee. (ab wapsi ka ikhtiyar nahin rahega , chahey majlis qaaim bhi ho)."
"4468","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jab do shakhs soda karen to un mein sey har eik ko apney sodey ki wapsi key barey main eik dusrey key juda honey tak ikhtiyar hasil hai. ya unki bai mein ikhtiyar khatam kar diya gaya ho. agar aisi baat hai to bai paki ho gaee. (ab wapsi nahin hogi)."
"4469","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey manqul hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : soda karney waley do shakhs wapsi ka ikhtiyar rakhtey hain jab tak wo eik dusrey sey juda na hon, ya phir un mein sey eik dusrey ko bai key doran hi mein keh dey ke ab pasand kar lo. (baad mein wapsi nahin hogi. aisi surat mein ikhtiyar nahin rahega)."
"4470","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey marwi hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : soda karney waley do log eik dusrey sey juda honey tak bai ki wapsi ka ikhtiyar rakhtey hain illa ye ke wo bai khiyaar ho, aur kabhi Naafey ney kaha (aap ney farmaya tha ) : ya un mein sey eik dusrey ko (soda kartey waqt ) keh dey : ab pasand kar ley (baad mein wapsi nahin hogi)."
"4471","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey bayan hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : soda karney waley do shakhs eik dusrey sey juda honey tak sodey ki wapsi ka ikhtiyar rakhtey hain illa ye ke wo ikhtiyar wala soda ho. aur kabhi Naafey ney kaha (aap ney farmaya tha ) : ya (soda kartey waqt) eik ney dusrey sey keh diya ho : abhi pasand kar ley."
"4472","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jab do shakhs soda karen to un mein sey har eik ko wapsi ka ikhtiyar rehta hai yahan tak ke wo eik dusrey sey juda hon. eik aur martaba (Naafey ney in alfaz sey) bayan kya ke (aap ney farmaya : in dono ko ikhtiyar hai) jab tak wo dono juda na hon aur ikhattey rahen illa ye ke un mein sey koi eik, dusrey ko (bai key waqt hi) ikhtiyar dey dey. agar bai key waqt hi un dono mein sey eik, dusrey ko ikhtiyar dey dey aur wo dono is par soda kar lein to soda pakka ho gaya. aur agar soda karney key baad wo eik dusrey sey juda ho jaeyn aur us waqt tak kisi ney bai wapis nahin ki to soda pakka ho gaya (ab wapis nahin hogi )."
"4473","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : do soda karney waley eik dusrey sey judai tak apney sodey ki wapsi ka ikhtiyar rakhtey hain illa ye ke wo soda khiyaar wala ho. Naafey ney kaha : Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhu) jab koi chiz khareedtey aur wo chiz in ko achi lagti to ( soda kartey hi) apney sathi sey juda ho jatey (taake wo wapis na kar sakey )."
"4474","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey manqul hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : do soda karney waley jab tak eik dusrey sey juda nahin ho jatey , unka soda pakka nahin hota illa ye ke wo soda kartey waqt ikhtiyar khatam kar lein."
"4475","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : soda karney waley do ashkhaas mein sey har eik key liye soda pakka nahin hota yahan tak ke wo juda ho jaeyn magar ikhtiyar wala soda."
"4476","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhu) sey marwi hai ke unhoney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey suna : soda karney waley do ashkhaas key darmiyan bai mustaqil nahin hoti yahan tak ke wo alag alag ho jaeyn ilawa ikhtiyar wali bai key."
"4477","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ka farman hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : bai karney waley do afrad key darmiyan bai paki nahin hoti yahan tak ke wo alag alag ho jaeyn ilawa bai khiyaar key."
"4478","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya ke mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey suna : soda karney waley do afrad key darmiyan soda mustaqil nahin hota yahan tak ke eik dusrey sey alag ho jaeyn magar khiyaar wali bai (ka hukm alag hai)."
"4479","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : har do soda karney walon key darmiyan soda pakka nahin hota yahan tak ke eik dusrey sey alag ho jaeyn magar khiyaar wali bai (ka hukm alag hai )."
"4480","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey marwi hai ke Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : soda karney waley do shakhs jab tak juda na hon, sodey ki wapsi ka ikhtiyar rakhtey hain illa ye ke wo soda khiyaar wala ho."
"4481","Hazrat Samra (Raziallahu anhu) sey manqul hai ke Allah key Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : soda karney waley do shakhs eik dusrey sey juda honey tak sodey ki wapsi ka ikhtiyar rakhtey hain, ya phir un mein sey har eik apni pasand ki bai kerey. aur wo dono teen dafa eik dusrey ko ikhtiyar dey den."
"4482","Hazrat Samra (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : soda karney waley do shakhs eik dusrey sey juda honey tak bai ki wapsi ka ikhtiyar rakhtey hain. ya un mein sey koi apney sathi sey uski hatmi raza mandi malum kar ley."
"4483","Hazrat Amr bin Shuaib key pardada mohtaram (Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhu) ) sey manqul hai ke Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : soda karney waley dono shakhs (kharidney aur bechney wlaey) juda honey tak sodey ki wapsi ka ikhtiyar rakhtey hain illa ye ke wo sodey key doran mein ikhtiyar khatam kar chukey hun. aur kisi eik fariq ko ijazat nahin ke wo sodey ki wapsi key dar sey apney sathi sey juda ho jaey."
"4484","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey manqul hai ke eik aadmi ney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey zikr kya ke ( aksar o beshtar ) uskey sath sodey mein dhoka aur faraib kya jata hai. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jab to soda karney lagey to keh diya kar : dhoka nahin chalega. phir wo aadmi jab bhi soda karta to keh diya karta tha ke dhoka nahin chalega."
"4485","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey manqul hai ke eik aadmi ki soojh bojh mein kuch kami thi. wo sodey kya karta tha (aur nuqsan uthata tha ) uskey ghar walon ney Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas hazir ho kar arz ki : aey Allah key Nabi ! is par sodey karney ki pabandi laga den. Allah key Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney us shakhs ko bulaya aur usey sodey karney sey mana farmaya. us shakhs ney kaha : aey Allah key Nabi ! main soda karney sey nahin ruk sakunga. aap ney farmaya : jab to soda karey to keh diya kar, dhoka nahin hona chahiye. ( warna soda wapis ho jaeyga )."
"4486","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jab tum mein sey koi shakhs bakri ya doodh wali oontni bechney ka irada rakhta ho to wo us ka doodh dohna band na kerey."
"4487","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : ghalley waley qaflon ko (mandi sey bahar ja kar) kharid-farokht key liye na milo aur oontni ya bakri ka doodh na roko. jo shakhs aisa janwer kharid ley to usey (doodh dohney key baad ) do chizon mein sey behtar ka ikhtiyar hai. agar chahey to janwer rakh ley aur agar wapis karna chahey to wapis kar dey aur uskey sath khajuron ka eik saa bhi dey."
"4488","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey marwi hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jis shakhs ney aisa janwer kharid jiska doodh roka gaya tha to (us dhokey ka pata chal janey par) wo ( kharidar ) chahey to usey rakh ley, chahey wapis kar dey (lekin wapsi ki surat mein) uskey sath khajuron ka eik saa bhi dena hoga."
"4489","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey marwi hai ke Abul-Qasim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jis shakhs ney aisa janwer kharid jis ka doodh thanon mein jama kya gaya tha, usey teen din tak ikhtiyar rehta hai, chahey to rakh ley, chahey wapis kar dey aur sath khajuron ka eik saa dey dey. gehun ka nahin."
"4490","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) farmati hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney faisla farmaya ke kisi chiz ka nafa usko milega jo us chiz ka zaamin hoga."
"4491","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mana farmaya ke koi tajir tijaarati qafley ko mandi sey bahar ja kar miley, ya koi shehri kisi Erabi (dehati) (dehati ) ki koi chiz bechey , ya koi apney janwer ka doodh rokey, ya koi shakhs najaaiz bhaaw badhaey ya koi shakhs kisi dusrey bhai key bhaaw par bhaaw kerey. ya koi aurat apni saukan ki Talaq ka mutalba kerey."
"4492","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mana farmaya ke koi shahri kisi dehati ka maal bechey agar-che wo us ka baap ya bhai ho."
"4493","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain ke hamen mana farmaya gaya ke koi shahri kisi dehati key liye saman bechey agar-che wo uska baap ya bhai ho."
"4494","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : hamen roka gaya hai ke koi shahri kisi dehati ka saman bechey."
"4495","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey manqul hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : koi shahri kisi dehati ka saman na bechey balke logon ko khud bechney do taake Allah Taala unko eik dusrey sey rizq ata farmaey."
"4496","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey manqul hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : tum sodey karney key liye tijaarati qaflon ko mandi sey bahar ja kar na milo . aur koi shakhs dusrey key sodey par soda na kerey. aur najaaiz bhaaw na badhaao. aur shahri dehati ka maal na bechey ."
"4497","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney bhaaw badhaaney, tijaarati qaflon ko aagey ja kar milney aur shahri ko dehati ka maal bechney sey mana farmaya hai."
"4498","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya ke koi tajir mandi sey bahar ja kar tijaarati qafley ko miley."
"4500","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mana farmaya ke koi tajir mandi aur bazar sey bahar hi tijaarati qafley ko miley ya koi shahri kisi dehati ka maal bechey. ( Hadees key raawi Janab Taoos ney kaha ke ) mainey Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey puchha : shehri ko dehati ka maal bechney sey rokney ka kya matlab hai? unhoney farmaya : wo us ka dalaal na baney."
"4501","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka farman hai : tijarati qaflon ko mandi sey bahar ja kar na milo . agar koi tajir mandi sey bahar ja kar milega aur qafley sey koi chiz kharidega to jab qafla bazar mein pahunchega, Malik ko ikhtiyar hoga ke wo soda wapis kar ley."
"4502","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : koi shehri kisi dehati ka maal farokht na kerey. dhokey sey bhaaw na badhaao, koi shakhs apney musalman bhai key bhaaw par bhaaw na karey aur na uskey peghame-nikah par pegham bhejey aur na koi aurat apni ( saukan ) behan ki Talaq ka mutalba karey taake uskey bartan ko undel dey balke usey chahiye ke wo bhi nikah karey jo uski qismat mein Allah Taala ney likha hai, usey mil jaeyga."
"4503","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : koi shakhs apney ( musalman ) bhai key sodey par soda na kerey."
"4504","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey manqul hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : koi shakhs apney bhai key sodey par soda na karey yahan tak ke wo kharid ley ya chhod dey."
"4505","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey marwi hai ke Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney heeley key sath bhaw badhaney sey mana farmaya hai."
"4506","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain ke mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey suna : koi aadmi apney (musalman) bhai key sodey par soda na kerey. koi shehri kisi dehati ka maal na bechey. bhaaw badhaaney ka heela na karo. koi shakhs apney bhai key tey shuda sodey sey ziyada ka lalach na dey aur koi aurat apni saukan ki Talaq ka mutalba na karey taake uskey bartan ko undel dey."
"4507","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : koi shehri kisi dehati ka maal na bechey. bhaaw na badhao. koi shakhs apney bhai key tey shuda sodey par izaafey ka lalach na dey aur koi aurat apni saukan ki Talaq ka mutalba na karey taake uskey bartan ko undel dey."
"4508","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney eik piyala aur eik taat nilami key zariey sey bechaa tha."
"4509","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mulaamisa aur munaabiza sey mana farmaya hai."
"4510","Hazrat abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mulaamisa aur munaabiza sey mana farmaya. mulaamisa ye hai ke kapdey ko chhua jaey, khol kar na dekha jaey. aur munaabiza ye hai ke bechney wala kapdey ko kharidar ki taraf phenk dey aur soda ho jaey baghair iskey ke wo us kapdey ko ulat palat kar dekhey."
"4511","Hazrat abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mulaamisa aur munaabiza qism key sodon sey mana farmaya."
"4512","Hazrat abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney do qism key sodon mulaamisa aur munaabiza sey mana farmaya."
"4513","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney munaabiza aur mulaamisa sey mana farmaya. mulaamisa ye hai ke do aadmi raat key andherey mein do kapdon ka is tarah soda karen ke un mein sey har eik dusrey key kapdey ko haath sey chhuey. aur munaabiza ye hai ke eik aadmi dusrey ki taraf kapda phenkey aur doosra uski taraf kapda phenkey. bas itney mein soda ho jaey."
"4514","Hazrat abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mulaamisa aur munaabiza sey mana farmaya. mulaamisa ye hai ke kapdey ko sirf chhua jaey. (achi tarah khol kar) dekha na jaey. aur munaabiza ye hai ke eik shakhs dusrey ki taraf kapda waghera phenkey lekin ulat palat karney ki ijazat na ho."
"4515","Hazrat abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney do qism key libas aur do qism key soodon sey mana farmaya hai. sodey to mulaamisa aur munaabiza hain. munaabiza ye hai ke bechney wala kahey ke jab main ye kapda phenk dunga, bai paki ho jaeygi. aur mulaamisa ye hai ke khareedney wala kapdey ko sirf haath sey chhuey aur usey khol kar ulat palat kar na dekhay. jab chu liya to soda pakka ho gaya."
"4516","Hazrat Salim key walid mohtaram (Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhu) ) ney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney do qism key libas sey mana farmaya. aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney hamen do qism key sodon sey mana farmaya : mulaamisa aur munaabiza. aur ye chand sodey they jo daure-jahiliyat mein log kya kartey they."
"4517","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey manqul hai ke Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney do qism key sodon sey mana farmaya. aur wo mulaamisa aur munaabiza hain. unhoney farmaya ke mulaamisa ye hai ke eik aadmi dusrey aadmi sey kahey : main tujhey apna kapda terey kapdey key iwaz bechtaa hun aur un mein sey koi bhi dusrey key kapdey ko na dekhey balke sirf chhuey . aur munaabiza ye hai ke eik shakhs dusrey sey kahey : main apni chiz phenkta hun, to apni chiz phenk taake un mein sey har eik dusrey sey uski chiz khareedey aur un mein sey kisi ko malum na ho ke dusrey key paas kya hai aur kitna hai."
"4518","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney kankariyon wali bai aur har dhokey wali bai sey mana farmaya hai."
"4519","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : phalon ka soda na karo yahan tak ke un ki salahiyat malum ho jaey. aap ney bechney waley ko bhi roka aur khareedney waley ko bhi."
"4520","Hazrat Salim key walid mohtaram (Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhu)) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney phal ki farokht sey roka yahan tak ke uski salahiyat zahir ho jaey."
"4521","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey manqul hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : phal ka soda na karo yahan tak ke uski salahiyat zahir ho jaey aur taza phal ( taza khajuren ) khushk khajuron key iwaz na kharido. ibne-Shahab (Imam Zohri ) ney kaha ke mujhey hadees bayan ki Salim bin Abdullah ney apney walid mohtaram Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhu) sey ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mana farmaya … phir usi ( hadees Abu-Hurera ) ki misl puri hadees bayan farmaai."
"4522","Anas bin Malik se riwayat hai ki RasoolAllah ne phal pakne se pehle bechne se mana farmaya. Kaha gaya: ya RasoolAllah pakne ka kya matlab hai? Aap ne farmaya: jab woh laal ho jaayein. Aur RasoolAllah ne farmaya: tum kya sochte ho agar Allah phal ko rok de (yaani pakne na de)?"
"4523","Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) sey marwi hai ke Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mukhaahira, muzaabna aur muhaaqla sey mana farmaya. aur us baat sey ke phalon ko un ki salahiyat zahir honey sey pehley farokht kya jaey ya taza phal ko khushk phal key iwaz bechaa jaey balke in ko deenar o dirham (rupye-paisey) key iwaz becha jaey, albatta aap ney Atiya key darakhton mein us bai ki ijazat ata farmaai hai."
"4524","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mukhaahira, mazaabna, muhaaqla aur pakney sey pehley phal bechney sey mana farmaya hai, albatta Atiya key darakhton mein mazabna ki ijazat ata farmaai hai."
"4525","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney khajuron ki bai sey mana farmaya yahan tak ke wo khaney key qabil ho jaeyn."
"4526","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney phal pakney sey pehley unko bechney sey mana farmaya. puchha gaya : aey Allah key Rasool! pakney ka kya matlab hai? aap ney farmaya : wo surkh ho jaeyn (pakney key qarib ho jaeyn aur kisi qism ki aafat ka ehtimaal na rahey.) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : batao agar Allah Taala phal rok ley to tum mein sey koi kis bina par apney bhai sey raqam lega ?"
"4527","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : agar to apney ( musalman ) bhai ko phal bechey , baad mein phal par koi na-gahani aafat aa jaey to terey liye uski qeemat lena halal nahin. to kis bina par apney bhai ka maal nahaq lega?"
"4528","Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs phal bechey, phir usko koi aafat pahunch jaey aur wo zaya ho jaey to wo apney bhai sey uski qeemat na ley. aur aap ney lafz «"
"4529","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya ke Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney na-gahani aafaat sey pahunchney waley nuqsanat ki talafi ka hukm farmaya hai."
"4530","Hazrat abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key daur mubarak main eik aadmi ka phal zaya ho gaya jo us ney kharid tha. is tarah wo bahut maqrooz ho gaya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya is par sadqa karo. logon ney is par sadqa kya lekin us sey us ka pura qarz ada nahin ho sakta tha. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney (us key qarz khaahon sey) farmaya : jo tumhein miley wo ley lo. uskey ilawa tumhein kuch nahin milega."
"4531","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney kaee saal key liye phal bechney sey mana farmaya hai."
"4532","Hazrat Salim key walid mohtaram (Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhu) ) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney khushk khajuron key badley darkht par lagi hui khajuron key sodey sey mana farmaya hai. Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : mujhey Hazrat Zaid bin Sabit (Raziallahu anhu) ney bayan farmaya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney atiye key darakhton mein us sodey ki rukhsat di hai."
"4533","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mazaabna sey mana farmaya. aur mazaabna ye hai ke darkht par laga huwa phal ( khajoor ) moayan wazan (ya maap) ki khushk khajuron key badley bechaa jaey ke agar khajoor ka phal ziyada huwa to uska faeyda bhi mujhey hai aur agar phal kam huwa to uska nuqsan bhi mujhey hoga."
"4534","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey manqul hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mazaabna sey mana farmaya hai. aur mazaabna ye hai ke taza khajuren (darkht par lagi hui) toli maapi hui khushk khajuron key badley aur darkht par lagey huye angoor maapey huye munaqqa key badley bechey jaeyn ."
"4535","Hazrat Raafey bin Khadij (Raziallahu anhu) sey marwi hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney khet mein ugi hui fasal ki bai khushk ghalley sey aur darkht par lagey huye phal ki bai khushk phal key sath karney sey mana farmaya hai."
"4536","Hazrat Zaid bin Sabit (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney Atiya key darakhton mein mazaabna ki ijazat di hai."
"4537","Hazrat Zaid bin Sabit (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney Atiya key darakhton mein rukhsat ata farmaai ke un par laga huwa phal khushk ya taza khajuron key iwaz becha ya kharid ja sakta hai."
"4538","Hazrat Zaid bin Sabit (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney rukhsat ata farmaai ke Atiya key darakhton ka phal andazan unkey barabar khushk khajuron key iwaz becha ya kharid ja sakta hai."
"4539","Hazrat Zaid bin Sabit (Raziallahu anhu) sey marwi hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney Atiya key darkht key phal key barey mein rukhsat ata farmaai ke usey andazey sey phal key barabar khushk khajuron key iwaz bechaa ja sakta hai."
"4540","Hazrat Zaid bin Sabit (Raziallahu anhu) sey marwi hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney ijazat ata farmaai ke Atiya key darakhton ka phal khushk ya taza khajuron key iwaz bechaa ja sakta hai, albatta aap ney uskey ilawa (us ki aam ) ijazat nahin di."
"4541","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney Atiya key darakhton key barey mein rukhsat ata farmaai ke unka phal andazey sey uskey barabar khajuron paanch wasq ya paanch wasq sey kam tak bechaa ja sakta hai."
"4542","Hazrat Saad bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey khushk khajuron key iwaz taza khajuren kharidney bechney key barey mein puchha gaya to aap ney farmaya : kya taza khajuren khushk ho kar kam ho jati hain? logon ney kaha : ji han, phir aap ney us saudey sey mana farma diya."
"4543","Hazrat Raafey bin Khadij aur Hazrat Sahal bin abi Hasma (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mazaabna sey mana farmaya, yani darkht par lagi hui khajuron ka soda khushk khajuron sey kya jaey, albatta aap ney Atiya waley darakhton key malikon ko ( paanch wasq tak ) us bai ki ijazat di."
"4544","Hazrat Bashir bin Yasar ney bahut sey sahaba kiram Raziallahu anhum sey bayan kya ke unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney Atiya key darakhton key phal ko andazey sey unkey barabar khushk khajuron key iwaz farokht karney ki ijazat di hai."
"4545","Hazrat Saad (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey taza khajuron key iwaz khushk khajuren khareedney ya bechney key barey mein puchha gaya to aap ney apney ird-gird bethey huye haazirin sey farmaya : kya taza khajoor khushk ho kar wazan mein kam ho jati hai? unhoney kaha : han, phir aap ney aisey sodey sey mana farma diya."
"4546","Hazrat Saad bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey khushk khajuron key iwaz taza khajuren kharidney bechney key barey mein puchha gaya to aap ney farmaya : kya taza khajuren khushk ho kar kam ho jati hain? logon ney kaha : ji han, phir aapney us sodey sey mana farma diya."
"4547","Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) sey marwi hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mana farmaya ke khajuron key us dher ka soda, jis ka wazan malum na ho, muqarrara wazan ki khajuron key sath kya jaey."
"4548","Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : ghalley ka eik dher dusrey dher key iwaz ya muqarrara wazan key ghalley key iwaz khareed becha na jaey."
"4549","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mazaabna sey mana farmaya hai. wo ye hai ke koi shakhs apney baagh ka phal, maslan taza khajuren khushk toli hui khajuron key iwaz bechey. isi tarah angooron ko toley huye munaqqa key iwaz bechey aur agar kheti ho to usey muqarrara ghalley key iwaz bechey. aap ney un tamam suraton sey mana farma diya."
"4550","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mukhaabira, mazaabna aur muhaaqla sey mana farmaya. aur phal khaney key qabil honey sey pehley uski bai sey bhi roka. aur in (sordon) ko deenar aur dirham (rupye-paisey) key baghair khareedney bechney sey mana farmaya."
"4551","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mana farmaya ke darkht key phal ka soda kiya jaey yahan tak ke wo rang badal jaey. aur sattey ka soda kiya jaey yahan tak ke wo safed ho jaey aur aafat sey mehfooz ho jaey. aap ney bechney waley ko bhi roka aur khareedney waley ko bhi."
"4552","Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key eik sahabi sey riwayat hai, unhoney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! hamen saihani aur azaq khajuren raddi aur mili-juli khajuron key barabar nahin mil saktin jab tak ke hum ziyada na den. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : apni raddi khajuren chaandi (raqam) key iwaz bech aur phir us (raqam) key sath (umda khajuren) khareed ley."
"4553","Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri aur Hazrat Abu-Hurera Raziallahu anhuma sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney Khaibar mein (khajuron ki wasuli key silsiley mein) eik aadmi muqarrar farmaya. wo umda (janeeb) khajuren ley kar aaya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kya Khaibar ki tamam khajuren aisi (aalaa) hoti hain? us ney kaha : nahin, aey Allah key Rasool ! hum mili-juli aur raddi khajuron key do saa dey kar us ka eik saa aur teen saa dey kar is qisam key do saa khareedtey hain. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : aisey na karo. raddi aur mili-juli khajuron ko raqam key sath alag becho aur phir raqam key sath behtar khajuren kharido."
"4554","Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas (rayyaan naami umda) tazi khajuren laee gaeen jabkey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki khajuren (ba'li zamin ki thin jin mein) kuchh khushki hoti hai. aap ney farmaya : ye tumhen kahan sey mil gaeen? logon ney kaha : ham ney apni khajuron key do saa dey kar ye eik saa key hisab sey khareedi hain. aap ney farmaya : aisey na karo. ye durust nahin balke apni khajuren alag raqam key iwaz farokht karo aur phir apni zarurat key mutabiq in ko alag raqam key sath kharido."
"4555","Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke hamen Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key daure-mubarak mein mili-juli (jame) khajuren di jati thin. hum unkey do saa dey kar (umda khajuron ka) eik saa ley liya kartey they. ye baat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko pahunchi to aap ney farmaya : do saa khajuron key iwaz eik saa khajuren na do, aur na do saa gehun key iwaz eik saa gehun do aur na eik dirham key iwaz do dirham do."
"4556","Hazrat Abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke hum mili-juli khajuron key do saa dey kar (umda khajuron ka) eik saa khareed liya kartey they. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : do saa khajuron key iwaz eik saa khajuren na do, aur na do saa gehun key iwaz eik saa gehun do aur na do dirham key iwaz eik dirham lo."
"4557","Hazrat Abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas barni khajuren ley kar aaye. aap ney farmaya : ye kaisi hain? wo boley : mainey (raddi khajuron key) do saa dey kar ye eik saa khareedi hain. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : uff ! ye khula sood hai. iskey qareeb na jao."
"4558","Hazrat Umar bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : soney ka soda chaandi key sath sood hai illa ye ke naqad (haath-o-haath) ho. khajuron ka soda khajuron key sath sood hai illa ye ke naqad ho. gehun ka gehun key sath sood hai illa ye ke naqad ho. aur jo ka jo key sath sood hai illa ye ke naqad ho."
"4559","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : khajoor ka soda khajoor key sath, gehun ka gehun key sath, jo ka jo key sath aur namak ka namak key sath haath-o-haath (barabar) hona chahiye. jo shakhs ziyada dey ya ziyada ley, us ney sood khaya, siwa iskey ke unkey rang mukhtalif hon."
"4560","Hazrat Muslim bin Yasar aur Abdullah bin Ateek sey riwayat hai ke eik manzil mein Hazrat Ubada bin Saamit aur Hazrat Muawiya Raziallahu anhuma jama huye to Hazrat Ubada (Raziallahu anhu) ney unhen bayan farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney hamen sona soney key badley, chaandi chaandi key badley, gehun gehun key badley, jo jo key badley aur khajoor khajoor key badley bechney sey mana farmaya hai. un mein sey eik ney kaha : aur namak namak key badley. aur dusrey ney ye nahin kaha, magar barabar barabar haath-o-haath. aur hamen hukm diya ke sona chaandi key iwaz bechen aur chaandi sona key iwaz aur gehun jo key iwaz aur jo gehun key iwaz haath-o-haath jis tarah chahen."
"4561","Hazrat Muslim bin Yasar aur (Abdullah bin Ubaid jinhen) ibne-Hurmuz (bhi) kaha jata hai, sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Ubada bin Saamit aur Hazrat Muawiya Raziallahu anhuma eik jagah ikhattey they to Hazrat Ubada (Raziallahu anhu) ney unhen farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney hamen sona soney key badley, chaandi chaandi key badley, khajoor khajoor key badley, gehun gehun key badley aur jo jo key badley bechney sey mana farmaya hai. un mein sey eik ney kaha : aur namak namak key badley. aur dusrey ney ye nahin kaha magar barabar barabar. un mein sey eik ney kaha : jo ziyada dey ya ziyada ley us ney sood khaya. aur dusrey ney ye nahin kaha. aur hamen hukm diya ke sona chaandi key iwaz bechen aur chaandi sona key iwaz aur gehun jo key iwaz aur jo gehun key iwaz haath-o-haath jis tarah chahen."
"4562","Hazrat Muslim bin Yasar aur Abdullah bin Ubaid sey riwayat hai, unhoney kaha : eik manzil mein Hazrat Ubada bin Saamit aur Hazrat Muawiya Raziallahu anhuma ikhattey huye to Hazrat Ubada ney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mana farmaya ke hum sona soney key badley, chaandi chaandi key badley, gehun gehun key badley, jo jo key badley aur khajoor khajoor key badley bechen. un mein sey eik ney kaha : aur namak namak key badley. aur dusrey ney ye nahin kaha magar barabar barabar misl-ba-misl. un mein sey eik ney kaha : jo ziyada dey ya ziyada ley us ney sood khaya. aur dusrey ney ye nahin kaha. aur hamen hukm diya ke hum sona chaandi key iwaz bechen aur chaandi sona key iwaz aur gehun jo key iwaz aur jo gehun key iwaz haath-o-haath jis tarah chahen. ye hadees Hazrat Muawiya ko pahunchi to wo khadey huye aur boley : logon ka kya haal hai ke wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey aisi hadeesen bayan kartey hain jo ham ney aap sey nahin suneen jabkey hum aap key sath rahey hain. ye baat Hazrat Ubada bin Saamit ko pahunchi to wo khadey huye aur hadees dohraai aur farmaya : hum wo zarur bayan karenge jo ham ney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey suna, chahey Muawiya ko nagawar ho."
"4563","Hazrat Ubada bin Saamit (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, wo Badri sahabi they aur unhoney Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey baiat ki thi ke hum Allah Taala (ki shariyat) key barey mein kisi malamat karney waley ki malamat ka khauf nahin rakhengey, ke Hazrat Ubada khutba denay key liye khadey huye aur farmaya : aey logon ! tum ney aisi bai (saudey) ijaad kar liye hain jinhen main nahin janta. khabardaar ! sona soney key badley wazan-ba-wazan, dalla ho ya sikka. aur chaandi chaandi key badley wazan-ba-wazan, dalla ho ya sikka. aur chaandi ko soney key iwaz haath-o-haath bechney mein koi harj nahin, aur chaandi ziyada ho (to bhi harj nahin). aur udhaar jayez nahin. khabardaar ! gehun gehun key badley mudd-ba-mudd. aur jo ko jo key badley mudd-ba-mudd bechney mein koi harj nahin jabkey jo ziyada ho. aur udhaar durust nahin. khabardaar ! khajoor khajoor key badley mudd-ba-mudd. yahan tak ke namak ka zikr mudd-ba-mudd kiya. jo ziyada dey ya ziyada talab karey us ney sood khaya."
"4564","Hazrat Ubada bin Saamit (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : sona soney key badley, dalla ho ya sikka, wazan-ba-wazan. aur chaandi chaandi key badley, dalla ho ya sikka, wazan-ba-wazan. aur namak namak key badley aur khajoor khajoor key badley aur gehun gehun key badley aur jo jo key badley barabar barabar misl-ba-misl. jo ziyada dey ya ziyada ley us ney sood khaya."
"4565","Hazrat Sulaiman bin Ali sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Abu-Mutawakkil hamarey paas sey bazaar mein guzrey. bahut sey log unki taraf uthey. un mein main bhi shamil tha. ham ney kaha ke hum aap sey sarf (sona-chaandi key tabaadley) key barey mein puchhney aaye hain. unhoney kaha ke mainey eik aadmi ko Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) sey kehtey suna : kya tumharey aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key darmiyan Abu-Saeed Khudri key siwa koi nahin? unhoney kaha : merey aur aap key darmiyan unkey siwa koi nahin. unhoney kaha ke sona soney key badley aur chaandi chaandi key badley. Sulaiman ney kaha : ya kaha : aur chaandi chaandi key badley aur gehun gehun key badley aur jo jo key badley aur khajoor khajoor key badley aur namak namak key badley barabar barabar. jo is sey ziyada dey ya ziyada ley us ney sood khaya. aur leney waley aur denay waley dono is mein barabar hain."
"4566","Hazrat Ubada bin Saamit (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey suna : sona barabar wazan diya jaey. (Yaqoob ney barabar wazan ka zikr nahin kiya.) to Hazrat Muawiya ney kaha : is (hadees) ki koi ehmiyat nahin. Hazrat Ubada ney farmaya : Allah ki qism ! mujhey parwa nahin ke main aisi zamin mein na rahun jahan Muawiya ho. main gawahi deta hun ke mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko ye farmatey suna hai."
"4567","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : deenar ka soda deenar sey karna ho aur dirham ka dirham sey to kami beshi jayez nahin."
"4568","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke deenar key badley deenar aur dirham key badley dirham ki bai mein kami ziyadti jayez nahin. ye hamarey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka ham sey ahad hai."
"4569","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : sona soney key badley tol kar aen barabar diya jaey, dalla ho ya sikka. chaandi chaandi key badley tol kar aen barabar di jaye, dalla ho ya sikka. jo ziyada dey ya ziyada ley us ney sood khaya."
"4570","Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : sona soney key badley na becho magar barabar barabar. aur eik ko dusrey par fazilat na do. aur chaandi chaandi key badley na becho magar barabar barabar. aur us mein sey koi chiz udhaar key iwaz naqad key sath na becho."
"4571","Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke meri aankhon ney dekha aur merey kanon ney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey suna. aap ney sona soney key badley aur chaandi chaandi key badley (ki bai) sey mana farmaya magar barabar barabar misl-ba-misl. aur udhaar ko naqad key sath na becho aur eik ko dusrey par fazilat na do."
"4572","Hazrat Ata bin Yasar sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) ney soney ya chaandi ka eik bartan uskey wazan sey ziyada soney ya chaandi key iwaz becha. Hazrat Abu-Darda (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko aisi bai sey mana farmatey suna hai magar barabar barabar."
"4573","Hazrat Fazala bin Ubaid (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke mainey Khaibar key din eik haar baara deenar ka kharida jis mein soney key ilawa moti aur mankey bhi lagey huye they. mainey usey khol kar alag kiya to us mein baara deenar sey ziyada sona nikla. ye baat Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey bayan ki gaee to aap ney farmaya : usey alag kiye baghair na becho."
"4574","Hazrat Fazala bin Ubaid (Raziallahu anhu) sey marwi hai ke jang Khaibar key din mujhey eik aisa haar mila jis mein soney key ilawa moti aur mankey bhi lagey huye they aur main usey bechna chahta tha. ye baat Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey bayan ki gaee to aap ney farmaya : uskey hisson ko eik dusrey sey alag karo phir usey becho."
"4575","Hazrat Abu-Minhaal sey riwayat hai ke merey eik shareek ney chaandi ka soda udhaar kar liya, phir wo merey paas aaya aur mujhey bataya. mainey kaha : ye to durust nahin. us ney kaha : Allah ki qism ! mainey ye soda bazaar mein kiya hai aur kisi ney mujh par aitraaz nahin kiya. phir main Hazrat Bara bin Aazib (Raziallahu anhu) key paas aaya aur un sey puchha to unhoney kaha : Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) Madina Munawra tashrif laye jabkey hum ye soda kiya kartey they. aap ney farmaya : jo naqad ho us mein koi harj nahin aur jo udhaar ho wo sood hai. phir unhoney mujh sey kaha : Zaid bin Arqam key paas jao. main unkey paas aaya aur un sey puchha to unhoney bhi aisi hi baat kahi."
"4576","Hazrat Abu-Minhaal ney farmaya : mainey Hazrat Bara bin Aazib aur Zaid bin Arqam (Raziallahu anhuma) sey soney aur chaandi key tabadley key barey mein puchha to unhoney kaha : hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key daur mein tijarat kiya kartey they. ham ney Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey sarf key barey mein puchha to aap ney farmaya : agar naqad ho to koi harj nahin aur agar udhaar ho to durust nahin."
"4577","Hazrat Abu-Minhaal sey riwayat hai ke mainey Hazrat Bara bin Aazib (Raziallahu anhu) sey sarf key barey mein puchha to unhoney kaha : Zaid bin Arqam sey puchho kyonkey wo mujh sey behtar aur ziyada ilm waley hain. phir mainey Zaid sey puchha to unhoney kaha : Bara sey puchho kyonkey wo mujh sey behtar aur ziyada ilm waley hain. phir dono ney kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney chaandi ko soney key iwaz udhaar bechney sey mana farmaya hai."
"4578","Hazrat Ubada bin Saamit aur Hazrat Muawiya Raziallahu anhuma eik manzil mein ikhattey huye to Hazrat Ubada (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mana farmaya ke hum sona soney key badley , chaandi chaandi key badley , gehun gehun key badley , jo jo key badley , khajuren khajuron key badley … dono mein sey eik ustaad ney ye alfaz ( jin mein namak ka zikr hai) bayan kiye they jabkey dusrey ney bayan nahin kiye … aur namak namak key badley bechein magar jabkey dono eik dusrey key barabar hon (aur soda naqad ho). jo shakhs ziyada dega ya lega, us ney soodi karobar kya … ye alfaz (jo shakhs ziyada dega ya lega us ney soodi karobar) bhi dono mein sey eik ustaad ney bayan kiye they, dusrey ney bayan nahin kiye … albatta aap ney hamen ijazat di ke hum soney ko chaandi key badley , chaandi ko soney key badley , gehun ko jo key badley aur jo ko gehun key badley jaisey chahen bechein b-sharte-ke soda naqad ho. ye hadees Hazrat Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) ko pahunchi to wo kehney lagey : ajeeb baat hai ke kuch log Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey aisi ahaadees bayan kartey hain jo hamney to nahin suni agar-che hum bhi aap key sath rahey hain. ye baat Hazrat Ubada bin Saamit (Raziallahu anhu) ko pahunchi to khadey ho kar dobara hadees padhi aur farmaney lagey : hamney jo baat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki zaban mubarak sey suni hai, zarur bayan kerengey agar-che Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) usey napasand hi kerey. (Imam Nasai (Rahmatullahi Alaih) farmatey hain ke ) Qatada ney us ( Muhammad bin Sirin ) ki mukhalifat ki hai. unhoney ye riwayat Muslim bin Yasar sey « بواسطۂ ابوالاشعث , عبادۃ » sey bayan ki hai."
"4579","Hazrat Ubada bin Saamit (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, wo Badri sahabi they aur unhoney Nabi akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey baiat ki thi ke hum Allah Taala ( ki shariyat ) key barey mein kisi malamat karney waley ki malamat ka khof nahin rakhengey. to Hazrat Ubada (Raziallahu anhu) khutba deney key liye khadey huye aur farmaya : aey logo ! tum ney kuch aisi kharid o farokht ki soorten shuru kar li hain ke main nahin janta wo kya hain? khabrdar! sona soney key badley tol kar barabar diya jaey dali ho ya sikka, chaandi chaandi key badley tol kar barabar di jaey dali ho ya sikka, albatta chaandi soney key badley ho to koi harj nahin ke chaandi ziyada ho jabkey soda naqad ho. udhaar durust nahin. khabrdar! gehun gehun key badley aur jo jo key badley maap kar barabar diye jaeyn, albatta jo ko gehun key badley naqad farokht kya jaey to koi harj nahin ke jo ziyada hun lekin udhaar durust nahin. khabrdar! khajoor-khajoor key iwaz maap kar barabar di jaey yahan tak ke aap ney namak ka bhi zikr farmaya ke wo bhi maap kar barabar diya jaey. jo shakhs ziyada dey ya ziyada ley, us ney soodi len-den kya."
"4580","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke mujhey Hazrat Usama bin Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) ney bayan kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : sood sirf udhaar (nasiya) mein hai."
"4581","Hazrat Abu-Saleh sey riwayat hai ke mainey Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) ko farmatey suna ke mainey Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey kaha : tum jo ye baat kehtey ho, kya ye tum ney Allah ki kitab mein paee hai ya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey suni hai? unhoney kaha : na mainey ye Allah ki kitab mein paee hai aur na Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey suni hai. lekin mujhey Hazrat Usama bin Zaid ney khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : sood sirf udhaar mein hai."
"4582","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain ke main Baqee mein oonton ka karobar kiya karta tha. (kabhi) soda deenaron sey karta to dirham ley liya karta. main Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) key ghar mein Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aaya aur arz ki ke aey Allah key Rasool ! main aap sey puchhna chahta hun ke main Baqee mein oont bechta hun, deenaron key iwaz bechta hun aur dirham ley leta hun? aap ney farmaya : usey us din key bhaav par leney mein koi harj nahin jab tak ke tum juda na ho aur tumharey darmiyan koi (udhaar) baqi na ho."
"4583","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain ke main soney ka chaandi key sath aur chaandi ka soney key sath soda kiya karta tha. main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aaya aur aap ko iski khabar di to aap ney farmaya : jab apney sathi sey soda karo to us sey juda na ho jab tak ke tumharey aur uskey darmiyan koi uljhan (udhaar) baqi ho."
"4584","Hazrat Saeed bin Juber sey riwayat hai ke wo is baat ko napasand kartey they ke wo dirham tehra kar deenar aur deenar tehra kar dirham len."
"4585","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke wo is mein koi harj nahin samajhtey they, yani deenar tehra kar dirham lena aur dirham tehra kar deenar lena."
"4586","Hazrat Ibrahim Nakhai sey riwayat hai ke dirham tehra kar deenar leney ko wo napasand kartey they jab wo qarz key taur par hon."
"4587","Hazrat Saeed bin Juber sey riwayat hai ke wo is mein koi harj nahin samajhtey they chahey qarz key taur par hi kyon na ho."
"4588","Is sanad sey bhi Saeed bin Juber sey isi tarah marwi hai. Abu Abdur-Rehman (Imam Nasai Rahmatullahi Alaih) farmatey hain ke mainey is maqam mein isey aisa hi paya hai."
"4589","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke main Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aaya aur arz ki ke zara thehro, mujhey aap sey puchhna hai ke main Baqee mein oont deenaron key iwaz bechta hun aur dirham ley leta hun? aap ney farmaya : usey us din key bhaav par leney mein koi harj nahin jab tak ke tum juda na ho aur tumharey darmiyan koi (udhaar) baqi na ho."
"4590","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke jab Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) Madina Munawra tashrif laye to aap ney tarazu mangwaya aur (merey liye wazan kiya aur) mujhey (mera haq) tol kar diya aur mujhey ziyada bhi diya."
"4591","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mujhey qeemat ada ki aur ziyada bhi diya."
"4592","Hazrat Suwed bin Qais (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain ke main aur Makhrafa Abdi ilaqa Hajar sey (bechney key liye) kapdey laye. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) Maqam Mina mein hamarey paas tashrif laye jabkey eik tolney wala ujrat par tol raha tha. aap ney hum sey eik shalwar kharidi aur tolney waley sey farmaya : tol aur jhukta hua tol."
"4593","Hazrat Abu-Safwaan (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain ke mainey hijrat sey pehley Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko eik shalwar bechi to aap ney mujhey jhukta hua tola."
"4594","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : maap Madiney walon key mutabiq hona chahiye aur wazan Makkey walon key mutabiq. ye alfaz Is-haq key hain."
"4595","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo aadmi ghalla (ghizai jins) khareedey wo usey pura wasul karney sey pehley na bechey."
"4596","Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs ghalla khareedey wo usey qabzey mein leney sey pehley na bechey."
"4597","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs ghalla khareedey wo usey na bechey yahan tak ke usey maap ley."
"4598","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke mainey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey isi tarah suna. aur us sey pehli (riwayat) yahan tak ke usey qabzey mein ley ley."
"4599","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey marwi hai ke jis chiz sey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mana farmaya wo ye hai ke ghalla pura wasul karney sey pehley becha jaey."
"4600","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs ghalla khareedey, wo usey qabzey mein leney sey pehley na bechey. ibne-Abbas ney farmaya : mera khayal hai ke har chiz ghalley hi ki manind hai."
"4601","Hazrat Hakim bin Hizam (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : khareeda hua ghalla qabzey mein leney sey pehley na becho."
"4602","Hazrat Hakim bin Hizam (Raziallahu anhu) sey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki ye hadees manqul hai."
"4603","Hazrat Hakim bin Hizam (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain ke mainey sadqey key ghalley mein sey kuchh ghalla kharida. qabzey mein leney sey pehley hi us mein mujhey nafa ho gaya. main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aaya aur aap sey iska zikr kiya to aap ney farmaya : usey qabzey mein leney sey pehley na becho."
"4604","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mana farmaya ke koi shakhs maap kar khareeda hua ghalla pura wasul karney sey pehley bechey."
"4605","Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key zamaney mein ghalla khareedtey they to aap hamarey paas kisi ko bhejtey jo hamen hukm deta ke hum usey us jagah sey jahan ham ney kharida hai, dusri jagah muntaqil karen usey bechney sey pehley."
"4606","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key daur mein bazaar key upar hissey mein andazey sey (ghalla) khareedtey they to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney unhen mana farmaya ke usey usi jagah bechen yahan tak ke usey (wahan sey) muntaqil kar len."
"4607","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key daur mein (aam taur par) sawaron sey ghalla khareedtey they to aap ney unhen mana farmaya ke usey usi jagah bechen jahan unhoney kharida hai yahan tak ke usey ghalley key bazaar mein muntaqil kar len."
"4608","Hazrat Salim apney walid sey riwayat kartey hain ke mainey logon ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key daur mein maar khatey dekha jab wo andazey sey ghalla khareed kar usey apney thikanon mein laney sey pehley bech daltey they."
"4609","Ummul-Mominin Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney eik Yahudi sey ghalla udhaar kharida aur apni zireh (bakhtar) uskey paas girwi rakhi."
"4610","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas jo ki roti aur basi charbi (roghni salan) ley kar gaey. unhoney farmaya : aur aap ney Madina Munawra key eik Yahudi key paas apni zireh girwi rakh kar us sey apney ghar walon key liye jo (ghalla) liya tha."
"4611","Hazrat Amr bin Shuaib apney baap sey, wo apney dada sey riwayat kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : qarz ki shart par bai (sauda), eik bai (saudey) mein do sharten aur aisi chiz ki bai jo tumharey paas na ho, halal nahin."
"4612","Hazrat Amr bin Shuaib apney baap sey, wo apney dada sey riwayat kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : koi shakhs aisi chiz ka soda nahin kar sakta jiska wo Malik na ho."
"4613","Hazrat Hakim bin Hizam (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke mainey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey puchha : aey Allah key Rasool ! merey paas eik aadmi aata hai aur mujh sey aisi chiz bechney ka mutalba karta hai jo merey paas nahin hoti. main usey bech dun phir bazaar sey uskey liye khareed laun? aap ney farmaya : jo chiz tumharey paas na ho usey na becho."
"4614","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abi Majalid sey riwayat hai ke mainey Hazrat ibne Abi Oofa (Raziallahu anhu) sey bai (sauda) salaf (ya salam) key barey mein puchha to unhoney farmaya : hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) aur Hazrat Abu-Bakar aur Hazrat Umar Raziallahu anhum key daur mein gehun, jo aur khajoor mein aise logon sey salaf (pehley daam dey kar) kiya kartey they jinkey baarey mein hamen malum nahin tha ke aaya unkey paas (maal) hai ya nahin. aur ibne-Abza ney bhi aisi hi baat kahi."
"4615","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abi Majalid sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Abu-Barda aur Abdullah bin Shaddad ka bai (sauda) salam ki baabat ikhtilaf ho gaya. unhoney mujhey Hazrat ibne Abi Oofaa (Raziallahu anhu) key paas bheja. mainey un sey puchha to unhoney farmaya : hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) aur Hazrat Abu-Bakar aur Hazrat Umar (Raziallahu anhum) key daur mein gehun, jo, munaqqa aur khajoor mein salaf kiya kartey they."
"4616","Hazrat Abu-Minhaal sey riwayat hai ke mainey Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey suna, unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) Madina Munawra tashrif laye aur wo (log) khajuron mein do do, teen teen saal key liye salaf kiya kartey they. aap ney unhen roka aur farmaya : jo shakhs salaf karey wo malum maap, malum wazan aur malum muddat tak salaf karey."
"4617","Hazrat Abu-Raafea' (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney eik aadmi sey eik jawan oont qarz liya. wo shakhs aap sey apney oont ki wapsi ka mutalba karney aaya. aap ney eik aadmi sey kaha : jao, us ko eik jawan oont khareed kar do. wo aaya aur bola : mujhey eik umda jawan oont hi mila hai. aap ney farmaya : usey dey do. kyonkey behtareen musalman wo hai jo adaegi mein sab sey achchha ho."
"4618","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey marwi hai ke eik shakhs ney Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey eik khas umr ka oont wapis leney ka mutalba kiya. aap ney farmaya : usey dey do. logon ko us sey badi umr ka oont hi mila. aap ney farmaya : usey dey do. us ney kaha : aap ney mujhey pura ada kar diya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : tum mein sey behtareen wo hain jo adaegi mein sab sey achchhey hain."
"4619","Hazrat Arbaz bin Saariyaa (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain ke mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko eik jawan oont diya tha. main taqazey key liye aaya to aap ney farmaya : han, main tumhen umda sawari key siwa ada nahin karunga. phir aap ney mujhey ada kiya aur umda ada kiya. aur eik dehati aaya jo aap sey apney oont ki wapsi mang raha tha. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : usey uski umr ka oont dey do. logon ney usey us sey behtar diya."
"4620","Hazrat Samura (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney haiwaan key badley haiwaan ki udhaar bai sey mana farmaya hai."
"4621","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke eik ghulam aaya aur us ney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey hijrat par baiat ki. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko malum nahin tha ke wo ghulam hai. phir uska aaqa usey talab karney aaya. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : usey merey haathon bech dey. phir aap ney usey do habshi ghulamon key iwaz khareed liya. phir uskey baad aap kisi sey us waqt tak baiat nahin letey they jab tak ye na puchh letey ke kya wo ghulam hai."
"4622","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka ye farman manqul hai ke hamal key hamal mein salaf (pehley daam) karna sood hai."
"4623","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney hamal key hamal ki bai (sauda) sey mana farmaya hai."
"4624","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey manqul hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney hamal key hamal ki bai (sauda) sey mana farma diya hai."
"4625","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney hamal key hamal ki bai sey mana farmaya hai. aur ye aisi bai thi jo zamanae-jahiliyat key log kiya kartey they. koi shakhs oontni key pet key bachchey key bachchey tak (ki muddat) par zibah key liye oont khareedta tha."
"4626","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney kaee saal tak key liye (phal ki) bai sey mana farmaya hai."
"4627","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney kaee saal tak key liye (phal ki) bai sey mana farmaya hai."
"4628","Ummul-Mominin Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key jism mubarak par qatar basti ki bani hui do moti chadaren thin. jab aap bethetey to un mein paseena aa jata jis sey wo bojhal ho jatin. falan Yahudi key yahan Sham sey kapda aaya tha. mainey kaha : kash aap uskey paas kehla bhejen aur us sey aasani honey tak (udhaar par) do kapdey khareed len. aap ney uskey paas kehla bheja to us ney kaha : mujhey malum hai ke Muhammad kya chahtey hain. wo to bas (maal) ley jana chahtey hain."
"4629","Hazrat Amr bin Shuaib apney baap sey, wo apney dada sey riwayat kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney qarz ki shart par bai (sauda), eik saudey mein do sharton aur ghair maqbooza chiz (jo cheez qabzey mein na ho) key munafaa sey mana farmaya hai."
"4630","Hazrat Amr bin Shuaib apney baap sey, wo (baap) apney baap sey, yahan tak ke Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr ka zikr kiya, riwayat kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : qarz ki shart par bai (sauda) aur eik saudey mein do sharten aur ghair maqbooza chiz ka munafaa halal nahin."
"4631","Hazrat Amr bin Shuaib apney baap sey, wo apney dada sey riwayat kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney qarz ki shart par bai (saudey), eik saudey mein do sharton, aisi chiz ki bai jo tumharey paas na ho aur ghair maqbooza chiz key munafaa sey mana farmaya hai."
"4632","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney eik bai (saudey) mein do bai (sharton) sey mana farmaya hai."
"4633","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney muhaaqla, mazaabna, mukhaabira aur istisna (jo malum na ho us) sey mana farmaya hai."
"4634","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney muhaaqla, mazaabna, mukhaabira, muaawma aur istisna sey mana farmaya hai. aur ariya mein rukhsat ata farmaai hai."
"4635","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs khajoor key darkht ki pewandkari karey phir uski jad bech dey to darkht ka phal pewandkari karney waley ka hoga, illa ye ke khareedney waley ney (phal ki) shart lagaai ho."
"4636","Hazrat Salim apney walid sey riwayat kartey hain ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs pewandkari key baad khajoor ka darkht khareedey to uska phal bechney waley ka hoga, illa ye ke khareedney waley ney shart lagaai ho. aur jo shakhs aisa ghulam khareedey jiskey paas maal ho to uska maal bechney waley ka hoga, illa ye ke khareedney waley ney shart lagaai ho."
"4637","Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke main Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key sath eik safar mein tha. mera oont sust ho gaya to mainey usey chhod dena chaha. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) mujhey miley aur uskey liye dua ki aur usey hanka to wo aisa chala jaisa pehley nahin chala tha. phir aap ney farmaya : usey eik oqiya mein merey haathon bech dey. mainey kaha : nahin. aap ney farmaya : usey bech dey. to mainey eik oqiya mein bech diya aur Madina tak us par sawari ki shart laga li. phir jab hum Madina pahunchey to main oont ley kar aaya aur uski qeemat mangi. phir main wapis aaya to aap ney merey paas kehla bheja. aap ney farmaya : kya tum samajhtey ho ke mainey tum sey bhao-tao isliye kiya tha ke tumhara oont ley lun? apna oont aur apney dirham ley lo."
"4638","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke main Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key sath apney pani waley oont par eik jang mein gaya. oont sust ho gaya to Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney usey hanka to wo chust ho gaya yahan tak ke lashkar sey aagey nikal gaya. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : aey Jabir ! main tumharey oont ko chust hi dekh raha hun. mainey kaha : aap ki barkat sey aey Allah key Rasool. aap ney farmaya : usey merey haathon bech dey aur Madina pahunchney tak uski peeth (sawari) tumharey liye hai. to mainey usey bech diya jabkey mujhey uski sakht zarurat thi lekin mujhey un sey sharm aai. phir jab hum apni jang sey farigh huye aur qareeb pahunchey to mainey un sey jaldi janey ki ijazat mangi. mainey kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! main naya dulha hun. aap ney farmaya : kunwari sey shadi ki ya bewah sey? mainey kaha : bewah sey, aey Allah key Rasool. Abdullah bin Amr shaheed ho gaey aur chhoti bachchiyan chhod gaey to mainey pasand na kiya ke unkey paas unhi jaisi (bachchi) laun, isliye mainey bewah sey shadi ki jo unhen sikhaye aur adab sikhaye. to unhoney mujhey ijazat dey di aur farmaya : apney ghar walon key paas raat ko jao. phir jab main (Madina) aaya to mainey apney mamun ko oont bechney ki khabar di to unhoney mujhey malamat ki. phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) tashrif laye to main subah oont ley kar gaya to unhoney mujhey oont ki qeemat, oont aur logon key sath hissa (bhi) diya."
"4639","Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key sath eik safar mein tha aur main oont par sawaar tha. aap ney farmaya : tum logon mein sab sey peechhey kyon ho? mainey kaha : mera oont sust ho gaya hai. aap ney uski dum pakad kar usey hanka to main logon mein sab sey aagey ho gaya, mujhey uskey sar ki fikr honey lagi. phir jab hum Madina key qareeb pahunchey to aap ney farmaya : oont ka kya haal hai, kya tum usey merey haathon bechtey ho? mainey kaha : nahin, balke wo aap hi ka hai aey Allah key Rasool aap ney farmaya : nahin, balke usey merey haathon bech dey. mainey kaha : nahin, balke wo aap hi ka hai. aap ney farmaya : nahin, balke usey merey haathon bech dey. mainey usey eik oqiya mein ley liya hai, us par sawaar raho, phir jab Madina pahuncho to usey hamarey paas le aao. phir jab main Madina aaya to usey unkey paas le aaya. unhoney farmaya : aey Bilal ! usey eik oqiya tol dey aur eik qiraat ziyada dey dey. mainey kaha : ye wo izafa hai jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mujhey diya tha, phir wo mujh sey juda na hua. mainey usey eik theli mein rakh liya aur wo merey paas raha yahan tak ke Harrah key din ehl-e-Shaam aaye aur unhoney hum sey jo liya so liya."
"4640","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) mujhey miley jabkey main apney naqis pani waley oont par sawaar tha. mainey kaha : hamarey paas hamesha hi naqis oont rehta hai, haey afsos! Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : aey Jabir ! kya tum usey merey haathon bechtey ho? mainey kaha : nahin, wo aap hi ka hai aey Allah key Rasool. aap ney farmaya : aey Allah ! isey bakhsh dey. aey Allah ! is par reham farma. mainey usey itney itney mein ley liya hai aur Madina tak uski peeth tumhen udhaar di. phir jab main Madina aaya to usey taiyar kiya aur usey ley kar aap key paas gaya. aap ney farmaya : aey Bilal ! usey uski qeemat dey do. phir jab main peeth pher kar gaya to aap ney mujhey bulaya. mujhey darr huwa ke kahin aap usey wapis na kar den. aap ney farmaya : wo tumhara hai."
"4641","Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key sath safar kar rahey they aur main pani waley oont par sawaar tha. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kya tum usey itney itney mein merey haathon bechtey ho? Allah tumhen bakhshey? mainey kaha : ji han, wo aap hi ka hai aey Allah key Nabi. aap ney farmaya : kya tum usey itney itney mein merey haathon bechtey ho? Allah tumhen bakhshey? mainey kaha : ji han, wo aap hi ka hai aey Allah key Nabi aap ney farmaya : kya tum usey itney itney mein merey haathon bechtey ho? Allah tumhen bakhshey? mainey kaha : ji han, wo aap hi ka hai. Abu-Nazra ney kaha : ye eik kalima tha jo musalman kehtey they : aisa aisa karo, Allah tumhen bakhshey."
"4642","Ummul-Mominin Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke mainey Barira ko khareeda to uskey maalikon ney uskey wala ki apney liye shart lagaai. mainey iska zikr Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey kiya to aap ney farmaya : usey azaad kar dey, kyonkey wala usi ka hai jo (qeemat ki) chaandi dey. unhoney farmaya : phir mainey usey azaad kar diya. unhoney farmaya : phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney usey bulaya aur usey apney khawind key barey mein ikhtiyar diya to us ney apney aap ko ikhtiyar kiya jabkey uska khawind azaad tha."
"4643","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke unhoney Barira ko azaad karney key liye usey khareedney ka irada kiya lekin uskey malikon ney uskey wala ki shart lagaai. unhoney iska zikr Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey kiya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : usey khareed aur azaad kar dey, kyonkey wala usi ka hai jo azaad karey."
"4644","Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Aaisha ney eik londi ko khareed kar azaad karney ka irada kiya. uskey maalikon ney kaha : hum usey tumharey haathon is shart par bechengey ke uska wala hamara hoga. unhoney iska zikr Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey kiya to aap ney farmaya : ye (shart) tumhen nahin rok sakti, kyonkey wala usi ka hai jo azaad karey."
"4645","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney maaley-ghanimat ko taqseem honey sey pehley bechney sey, hamila (laundiyon) sey waza-hamal sey pehley sohbat karney sey aur har phadney waley darindey key gosht sey mana farmaya hai."
"4646","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : shuf'a har mushtarka (saanjhey) mein hai, khawah makaan ho ya baagh. uskey liye durust nahin ke wo apney shareek ko ittela diye baghair bechey. phir agar wo bech dey to wo (shareek) us waqt tak uska ziyada haqdaar hai jab tak usey ittela na dey."
"4647","Hazrat Ammara bin Khuzaima key chacha mohtaram sey riwayat hai, aur wo Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key sahabi they, ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney eik dehati sey ghoda khareeda aur usey kaha ke qeemat leney key liye peechhey peechhey aaye. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney tez raftari ikhtiyar ki aur dehati sust raha. log us sey (ghoda) khareedney lagey jabkey wo nahin jantey they ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) usey khareed chukey hain, yahan tak ke un mein sey baaz ney us qeemat sey ziyada bhao lagaya jis par unhoney us sey khareeda tha. phir dehati ney Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko pukara aur bola : agar tum is ghodey ko khareedney waley ho to (ley lo) warna main usey bech dunga. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) uski pukar sun kar khadey huye aur farmaya : kya mainey usey tum sey nahin khareeda? us ney kaha : nahin, Allah ki qism ! mainey usey tumharey haathon nahin becha. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : mainey usey tum sey khareed liya hai. log Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) aur dehati key gird jama honey lagey jabkey dono bahas kar rahey they aur dehati kehney laga : koi gawah lao jo gawahi dey ke mainey usey tumharey haathon becha hai. Khuzaima bin Saabit ney kaha : main gawahi deta hun ke tum ney usey becha hai. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) Khuzaima ki taraf mutawajjeh huye aur farmaya : tum kyon gawahi detey ho? unhoney kaha : aap ki tasdeeq ki wajeh sey aey Allah key Rasool. to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney Khuzaima ki gawahi ko do mardon ki gawahi qarar diya."
"4648","Hazrat Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey suna : jab do soda karney waley ikhtilaf karen aur unkey darmiyan koi gawah na ho to baat maal key maalik ki mani jaeygi, ya dono soda khatam kar den."
"4649","Hazrat Abdul-Malik bin Ubaid sey riwayat hai ke hum Hazrat Abu-Ubaida bin Abdullah bin Masood ki majlis mein hazir they ke unkey paas do aadmi aaye jinhoney aapas mein soda kiya tha. un mein sey eik ney kaha : mainey itney itney mein liya hai. aur dusrey ney kaha : mainey itney itney mein becha hai. Hazrat Abu-Ubaida ney farmaya : ibne-Masood key paas aisa hi muqadma laya gaya tha. unhoney farmaya : main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas hazir tha ke aap key paas aisa hi muqadma laya gaya. aap ney bechney waley ko hukm diya ke qism khaye, phir khareedney waley ko ikhtiyar hoga. agar chahey ley ley aur agar chahey chhod dey."
"4650","Ummul-Mominin Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney eik Yahudi sey ghalla udhaar kharida aur apni zireh uskey paas girwi rakhi."
"4651","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki wafaat hui jabkey aap ki zireh apney ghar walon key liye tees saa jo key iwaz eik Yahudi key paas girwi thi."
"4652","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke banu Uzra key eik aadmi ney apna eik ghulam mudabbir kiya. ye baat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko pahunchi to aap ney farmaya : kya tumharey paas iskey ilawa koi maal hai? us ney kaha : nahin. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : mujh sey usey kon khareedega? to Hazrat Nuaim bin Abdullah Adwi (Raziallahu anhu) ney usey aath sau dirham mein khareed liya. phir aap usey (qeemat ko) laye aur usey dey diya, phir farmaya : pehley apni zaat sey shuru karo."
"4653","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke ansaar mein sey eik aadmi ney jisey Abu-Mazkur kaha jata tha, apna eik ghulam mudabbir kiya jisey Yaqoob kaha jata tha. uskey paas uskey siwa koi maal nahin tha. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney usey (ghulam ko) talab farmaya aur farmaya : usey kon khareedega? to Hazrat Nuaim bin Abdullah ney usey aath sau dirham mein khareed liya aur (qeemat) usey dey di. aur farmaya : jab tum mein sey koi faqir ho to pehley apni zaat sey shuru karey. phir agar (maal) bachey to apney ehl-o-ayaal par. phir agar (maal) bachey to apney rishtedaaron ya azeezon par. phir agar (maal) bachey to yahan aur wahan."
"4654","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey marwi (riwayat hui) hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney eik mudabbir bech diya tha."
"4655","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Barira Aaisha key paas aai. wo apni kitaabat key barey mein un sey kuchh madad ki talabgar thi. Aaisha ney us sey kaha : apney maalikon key paas wapis jao. agar wo pasand karen ke main tumhari kitaabat (ki raqam) tumhari taraf sey ada kar dun aur tumhara wala mera ho jaey to main karungi. Barira ney apney maalikon sey iska zikr kiya to unhoney inkar kiya aur kaha : agar wo tum par ehsaan karna chahey to karey lekin tumhara wala hamara hoga. unhoney iska zikr Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey kiya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney us sey farmaya : usey khareed ley aur aazad kar dey, kyonkey wala usi ka hai jo aazad karey. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : logon ka kya haal hai ke wo aisi sharten lagatey hain jo Allah ki kitab mein nahin? jo koi aisi shart lagaye jo Allah ki kitab mein nahin to wo uski nahin, chahey sau sharten lagaye. aur Allah ki shart ziyada haq wali aur mazboot hai."
"4656","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) farmati hain ke Barira merey paas aai aur kehney lagi : aey Aaisha ! mainey apney maalikon sey nau oqiye par kitaabat ki hai, har saal eik oqiya. meri madad karo. us ney apni kitaabat mein sey kuchh bhi ada nahin kiya tha. Aaisha ney us sey kaha, aur us mein raghbat rakhtey huye : apney maalikon key paas wapis jao. agar wo pasand karen ke main unhen ye (raqam) ikhatti dey dun aur tumhara wala mera ho jaey to main karungi. Barira apney maalikon key paas gaee aur unkey saamney ye pesh kiya to unhoney inkar kar diya aur kaha : agar wo tum par ehsaan karna chahey to karey aur ye (wala) hamara hoga. Hazrat Aaisha ney iska zikr Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey kiya to aap ney farmaya : ye tumhen us sey nahin rokta, usey khareed ley aur aazad kar dey, kyonkey wala usi ka hai jo aazad karey. unhoney aisa hi kiya. aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) logon mein khadey huye, Allah ki hamd ki, phir farmaya : amma baad, logon ka kya haal hai ke wo aisi sharten lagatey hain jo Allah ki kitab mein nahin? jo koi aisi shart lagaye jo Allah ki kitab mein nahin to wo baatil hai, chahey sau sharten hon. Allah ka faisla ziyada haq wala aur Allah ki shart ziyada mazboot hai. aur wala usi ka hai jo aazad karey."
"4657","Hazrat Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney wala key bechney aur (uskey) hibey sey mana farmaya hai."
"4658","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney wala ko bechney aur hibey sey mana farmaya hai."
"4659","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney wala ko bechney aur hibey sey mana farmaya hai."
"4660","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney pani bechney sey mana farmaya hai."
"4661","Hazrat Abu-Minhaal sey riwayat hai ke mainey Hazrat Iyaas bin Umar sey suna. aur eik dafa kaha : ibne-Abd sey, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) pani bechney sey mana farmatey hain. Qutaiba ney kaha : main Abu-Minhaal ki baaz ibarat samajh nahin saka jaisa main chahta tha."
"4662","Hazrat Iyaas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney zayed pani bechney sey mana farmaya hai."
"4663","Hazrat Iyaas bin Abd (Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key sahabi) sey riwayat hai ke zayed pani na becho kyonkey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney zayed pani bechney sey mana farmaya hai."
"4664","Hazrat ibne-Waala Misri sey riwayat hai ke unhoney Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey angoor key nichodey huye (joos) key barey mein puchha. ibne-Abbas ney farmaya : eik aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko sharab ki mashk hadiya ley kar aaya. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney us sey farmaya : kya tumhen malum nahin ke Allah Azza wa Jalla ney usey haram kar diya hai? phir us ney sargoshi ki aur main samajh nahin saka jaisa main chahta tha. mainey apney pehlu mein bethey huye eik shakhs sey puchha. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney us sey farmaya : tum ney us sey kya sargoshi ki us ney kaha : mainey usey usey bechney ko kaha tha. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jis ney uska peena haram kiya us ney uski bai (khareed-farokht) ko bhi haram kiya. phir unhoney dono mashkon ko khol diya yahan tak ke jo kuchh un mein tha beh gaya."
"4665","Ummul-Mominin Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke jab sood ki (hurmat ki) aayaat utrin to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) mimbar par khadey huye aur unhen logon ko padh kar sunaya, phir sharab ki tijarat ko haram qarar diya."
"4666","Hazrat Abu-Masood Uqba bin Amr (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney kuttey ki qeemat, zaniya ki ujrat aur kahin ki mithai (ujrat) sey mana farmaya hai."
"4667","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney bahut si haram kardah chizon key barey mein farmaya : aur kuttey ki qeemat (bhi haram hai)."
"4668","Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney kuttey aur billi ki qeemat sey mana farmaya hai, siwa shikari kuttey key. Abu Abdur-Rehman (Imam Nasai) ney farmaya : ye (riwayat) munkar hai."
"4669","Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke unhoney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko Fath-Makka key saal Makka Mukarrama mein farmatey suna : be-shak Allah aur uskey Rasool ney sharab, murdaar, khinzeer aur buton ki bai (khareed-farokht) ko haram qarar diya hai. arz kiya gaya : aey Allah key Rasool ! murdaar ki charbi key barey mein kya khayal hai? kyonkey us sey kashtiyon par roghan kiya jata hai aur khalon ko chikna kiya jata hai aur log us sey chiragh jalatey hain? aap ney farmaya : nahin, wo haram hai aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney usi waqt farmaya : Allah Yahud ko halak karey. Allah ney jab un par uski charbi haram ki to unhoney usey pighlaya, phir becha aur uski qeemat khaee."
"4670","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney oont ki jufti ki ujrat, pani bechney aur kheti key liye zamin ki bai sey mana farmaya hai. koi shakhs apni zamin aur apna pani bechey, Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney isi sey mana farmaya hai."
"4671","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney nar ki jufti ki ujrat sey mana farmaya hai."
"4672","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke banu Sa'aq (jo banu Kilaab mein sey hai) ka eik aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aaya aur aap sey nar ki jufti ki ujrat key barey mein puchha. aap ney usey mana farmaya. us ney kaha : hum is par unki izzat kartey hain."
"4673","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney hajjam ki kamai, kuttey ki qeemat aur nar ki jufti ki ujrat sey mana farmaya hai."
"4674","Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney nar ki jufti ki ujrat sey mana farmaya hai."
"4675","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney hajjam ki kamai, kuttey ki qeemat aur nar ki jufti ki ujrat sey mana farmaya hai."
"4676","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs dewaliya ho jaey phir koi shakhs apna wohi saman uskey paas paey to wo dusron ki nisbat uska ziyada haqdaar hai."
"4677","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki ye hadees manqul hai ke jo shakhs dewaliya ho jaey aur uskey paas wohi saman paaya jaey aur pehchana jaey ke wo usi ka hai jis ney usey becha tha (to wo usi ka hoga)."
"4678","Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key daur mein eik aadmi ko khareedey huye phalon mein nuqsan pahuncha aur us par qarz badh gaya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : us ko sadqa do. logon ney usey sadqa diya lekin wo uskey qarz ki adaegi key liye kaafi na hua. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo kuchh pao ley lo. iskey siwa tumharey liye kuchh nahin"
"4679","Hazrat Usaid bin Huzair bin Simaak (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney faisla farmaya ke jab koi shakhs apna (chori shuda) maal ghair-muttahim shakhs key haath mein paey to agar chahey usey uski khareed ki qeemat dey kar ley ley aur agar chahey chor ka peechha karey. aur Hazrat Abu-Bakar aur Hazrat Umar ney bhi aisa hi faisla farmaya."
"4680","Hazrat Usaid bin Zuher Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) jo ke Yamaama key governer they, ney bataya ke mujhey Hazrat Marwan ney likha ke Hazrat Muawiya ney unhen likha hai ke jis shakhs ki koi chiz chori ho jaey wo jahan usey paey uska ziyada haqdaar hai. phir Marwan ney mujhey isi barey mein likha to mainey Marwan ko likha ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney faisla farmaya hai ke jab usey chor sey khareedney wala ghair-muttaham (be-gunah) ho to uska maalik ikhtiyar rakhta hai : agar chahey to jis sey chori hua wo uski qeemat dey kar ley ley, aur agar chahey to apney chor ka peechha karey. phir Hazrat Abu-Bakar, Umar aur Usman ney bhi isi ka faisla kiya. Marwan ney mera khat Muawiya ko bheja aur Muawiya ney Marwan ko likha : na tum mujh par faisla kartey ho aur na Usaid, lekin main tum par faisla karta hun jiska mujhey ikhtiyar diya gaya hai, to jo mainey tumhen hukm diya usey naafiz karo. Marwan ney Muawiya ka khat (mujhey) bheja to mainey kaha : jab tak mujhey ikhtiyar hai main Muawiya key qaul par faisla nahin karunga."
"4681","Hazrat Samura (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : aadmi apney aen (asal) maal ka ziyada haqdaar hai jab wo usey paa ley. aur khareedney wala (qeemat key liye) bechney waley key peechhey jaey."
"4682","Hazrat Samura (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jis aurat ka nikah do wali kar den wo pehley waley ki hogi. aur jo shakhs do aadmiyon sey bai (sauda) karey to wo (maal) pehley waley ka hoga."
"4683","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abi Rabeea (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mujh sey chaalis hazar (dirham) qarz liye. phir aap key paas maal aaya to aap ney mujhey ada kar diya aur farmaya : Allah tumharey ehl-o-ayaal aur maal mein barkat dey. qarz ka badla to shukriya aur adaegi hi hai."
"4684","Hazrat Muhammad bin Jahash (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain ke hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas bethey they ke aap ney apna sar aasman ki taraf uthaya, phir apni hatheli apni peshani par rakhi, phir farmaya : Subhan Allah ! kaisi sakht waeed utri hai. hum khamosh ho gaey aur dar gaey. phir jab agli subah hui to mainey puchha : aey Allah key Rasool ! ye kya sakht waeed utri hai? aap ney farmaya : qism us zaat ki jiskey haath mein meri jaan hai ! agar koi shakhs Allah key raastey mein qatl kiya jaey, phir zinda kiya jaey, phir qatl kiya jaey aur us par qarz ho to wo jannat mein dakhil nahin hoga jab tak uska qarz ada na kar diya jaey."
"4685","Hazrat Samura (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain ke hum Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key sath eik janazey mein they. aap ney farmaya : kya yahan falan khandan ka koi aadmi hai? teen dafa (farmaya). phir eik aadmi khada hua. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney us sey farmaya : pehli do dafa jawab denay sey tumhen kis ney roka tha? khabardaar ! mainey tumhen bhalai key siwa kuchh nahin kaha. un mein sey falan shakhs qarz mein jakda hua faut hua hai."
"4686","Hazrat Imran bin Huzefa sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Memuna (Raziallahu anha) qarz liya karti thin aur ziyada liya karti thin. unkey rishte-daaron ney un sey is par aitraaz kiya aur unhen malamat ki aur un sey naraaz huye. unhoney farmaya : main qarz lena nahin chhodungi. mainey apney khalil aur safee (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey suna hai, farmatey they : jo shakhs qarz ley aur Allah janta ho ke wo uski adaegi ka irada rakhta hai to Allah uski taraf sey dunya mein hi ada farma deta hai."
"4687","Hazrat Ubedullah bin Abdullah bin Utba sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki biwi Hazrat Memuna (Raziallahu anha) ney qarz liya. un sey kaha gaya : aey Ummul-Mominin ! tum qarz leti ho jabkey tumharey paas adaegi ki gunjaaish nahin? unhoney farmaya : mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey suna hai, farmatey they : jo shakhs qarz ley aur wo uski adaegi ka irada rakhta ho to Allah Azza wa Jalla uski madad farmata hai."
"4688","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka ye farman manqul hai ke jab tum mein sey kisi ko maal-daar shakhs par hawala kiya jaey to wo usey qubul karey. aur maal-daar ka (adaegi mein) taal-matol karna zulm hai."
"4689","Hazrat Amr bin Shareed apney baap sey riwayat kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : adaegi ki gunjaaish rakhney waley ka taal-matol karna uski izzat aur saza ko halal kar deta hai."
"4690","Hazrat Amr bin Shareed apney baap sey, wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey riwayat kartey hain ke adaegi ki gunjaaish rakhney waley ka taal-matol karna uski izzat aur saza ko halal kar deta hai."
"4691","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : maal-daar ka (qarz ki adaegi mein) taal-matol karna zulm hai. aur jab tum mein sey kisi ko maal-daar par hawala kiya jaey to wo usey qubul karey."
"4692","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abi Qatada apney baap sey riwayat kartey hain ke ansaar mein sey eik aadmi ka janaza Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein laya gaya taake aap uski namaz padhen. aap ney farmaya : tumharey sathi par qarz hai. Hazrat Abu-Qatada ney kaha : main uska zamin hun. aap ney farmaya : (adaegi) puri puri? unhoney kaha : puri puri."
"4693","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : tum mein sey behtareen wo hain jo adaegi mein sab sey achchhey hain."
"4694","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : eik aadmi ney kabhi koi neki nahin ki thi aur wo logon ko qarz diya karta tha. wo apney numainday sey kehta tha : jo aasan ho wo ley lo aur jo mushkil ho usey chhod do. aur darguzar karo taake Allah Taala hum sey darguzar farmaye. phir jab wo faut hua to Allah Azza wa Jalla ney us sey farmaya : kya tum ney kabhi koi neki ki? us ney kaha : nahin, siwa iskey ke mera eik ghulam tha aur main logon ko qarz diya karta tha. phir jab main usey taqazey key liye bhejta main us sey kehta : jo aasan ho wo ley lo aur jo mushkil ho usey chhod do aur darguzar karo taake Allah hum sey darguzar farmaye. Allah ney farmaya : mainey tum sey darguzar kiya."
"4695","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : eik aadmi logon ko qarz diya karta tha. jab wo kisi tang-dast ko dekhta to apney londey sey kehta tha : us sey darguzar karo taake Allah Taala hum sey darguzar farmaye. phir wo Allah sey mila to Allah ney us sey darguzar farmaya."
"4696","Hazrat Usman bin Affaan (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : Allah Taala ney eik aadmi ko jannat mein dakhil farmaya jo khareed-farokht mein, qarz ki adaegi mein aur taqazey mein narm tha."
"4697","Hazrat Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke mainey, Ammaar aur Saad ney Badr key din shirkat ki. Saad do qaidi ley kar aaye aur main aur Ammaar kuchh nahin laye."
"4698","Hazrat Salim apney walid sey riwayat kartey hain ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs apney hissay key ghulam ko azaad karey to baqi (hissa) uskey maal mein sey pura kiya jaeyga agar uskey paas ghulam ki qeemat ko pahunchney wala maal ho."
"4699","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs apney hissay key ghulam ko azaad karey aur uskey paas ghulam ki qeemat ko pahunchney wala maal ho to wo uskey maal mein sey azaad hai."
"4700","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : tum mein sey jis shakhs key paas zamin ya khajoor key darkht hon wo unhen na bechey yahan tak ke apney shareek par pesh karey."
"4701","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney har mushtarak chiz mein shuf'a ka faisla farmaya jo taqseem na hui ho, khawah makaan ho ya baagh. uskey liye halal nahin ke wo apney shareek ko ittela diye baghair bechey. phir agar chahey ley ley aur agar chahey chhod dey. aur agar bech dey aur usey ittela na dey to wo (shareek) uska ziyada haqdaar hai."
"4702","Hazrat Abu-Raafea' (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : padosi apney qurb (nazdeeki zamin) ka ziyada haqdaar hai."
"4703","Hazrat Amr bin Shareed apney baap sey riwayat kartey hain ke eik aadmi ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! meri zamin mein koi shakhs shareek nahin, na taqseem hai siwa pados key. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : padosi apney saqab ka ziyada haqdaar hai."
"4704","Hazrat Abu-Salma sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : shuf'a har us maal mein hai jo taqseem na hua ho. phir jab hudud waqey ho jaeyn aur raastey malum ho jaeyn to phir shuf'a nahin."
"4705","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney shuf'a aur pados key haq ka faisla farmaya."
